# THE SAW HALL AT THE CURFEW, WALKED UPRIGHT (21_doors `docks`, `_trespass`): the
# same way to the kiln at a walk, standing up. A walk is heard the length of
# the hall, and a hauler asleep in its dock wakes and takes whoever is in its
# store for a thief (Roles.TURNS: a worker turns on theft).
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/sawhall-wake.tour --seed=4 --hour=23 --weather=clear:0
#
# 01 is the moment one wakes and turns (`woke`).
coast calm
near door:saw_hall
await door 5
press use 0.1
await inside:saw_hall 5
wait 0.3
walkto strongbox 90
await woke 20
wait 0.6
shot 01-a-hauler-wakes with inside:saw_hall,mob:hauler
